# Opinion summaries are not Nunus

**NYT Opinion Summaries** (currently 1.0.6) is a separate unpacked extension:

`/Users/acypher/Projects/extensions/NYTOpinionSummaries`

Nunus only grays headlines the user has already seen. Do not add Ollama, article-body fetch, homepage Opinion-card summaries, or `startOpinionsSummaries` to this repo. Summary work belongs in that other project.
